 ### [TangoGS](10180-tangogs.md)
-TangoGS is a density controller for 3D Gaussian Splatting that automatically scales the number of Gaussians across different capture sizes without per-capture retuning. It combines a capture-derived learning allowance (model sizing) with training-based adaptation (quality feedback) to determine the target Gaussian population. Unlike sibling methods that rely on fixed defaults or per-capture tuning, TangoGS ensures the model budget is invariant to redundant views by using track-adjusted pixels normalized against standard scenes.
